/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 4.6-stable, 4.6.2-stable\n- Not reproducible in 4.5.2-stable\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.2.stable - Arch Linux #1 SMP PREEMPT_DYNAMIC Thu, 02 Apr 2026 23:33:01 +0000 on Wayland - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4060 (nvidia; 580.126.09) - AMD Ryzen 5 7600 6-Core Processor (12 threads) - 30.42 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nThis code in a shader causes the engine to freeze and sometimes segfault:\n\n```\ndo {} while (false);\n```\n\nThe code is a little bit weird to look at, but it's a [common pattern in preprocessor macros](https://stackoverflow.com/questions/9495962/why-use-do-while-0-in-macro-definition#9496022), which is how I encountered this issue in my project. Changing the contents of the {} doesn't affect whether it crashes.\n\nThis happens with spatial shaders and sky shaders at least. It affects the editor as well.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Open the reproducer\n2. View either minimal.tscn or minimal2.tscn in the editor's 3D viewport.\n3. The editor stops responding\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[do_while_shader.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/26636305/do_while_shader.zip)\n\n`minimal.tscn` has the do-while code in a sky shader\n\n`minimal2.tscn` has the do-while code on a shader on a 3D quad mesh","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118389/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":2},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118389/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}